%% Voice interview sequence
sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Candidate Browser
  participant W as Voice WebSocket Gateway
  participant S as Speech Components
  participant A as Shared Answer Service
  participant O as Interview Orchestrator
  U->>W: Connect with token and session
  W->>W: Verify origin identity and ownership
  U->>W: PCM audio frames
  W->>S: Bounded audio stream
  S-->>W: Partial and final transcript
  W->>A: Submit final transcript as answer
  A->>O: Evaluate and select next action
  O-->>W: Next question text or completion
  W->>S: Synthesize question text
  S-->>U: Stream PCM response audio
